* slide command test - glissando realized on the following note (the 'to' pitch).
*   slide 3c,4c,2  -> glide from 3c to 4c over the half-note (2 = 1/2) 4c.
title   SLIDE1
tempo   160,4
measure 1
voice   1
volume  5
cis     1
slide   3c,4c,2
4c 2
4e 2
measure 2
4g 1
measure 3
slide   3g,5c,1
5c 1
measure 4
slide   4c,3c,2
3c 2
4d 2
cstop*